{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/a8187b6ab3a26c6a567df4ae04923075.avif?t=1697803710\" width=192 height=192 /></span><br>A Whisper in the Twilight is a first person Mystery/Sci-Fi/Puzzle game. A wholly unique player experience, aiming to reinvent the single-player genre.<br><br>If you want to immerse yourself in the story before playing, we recommend you read/download for free the short graphic novel that serves as a prologue to this adventure directly from the game's official website:<br><br><br>The game will be released in ten self-contained Chapters.<br>&quot;CHAPTER ONE: THE JOURNEY BEGINS&quot; is the first one.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/1b8d998256d6a702c61432c4719df38d.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><br>The concept of A Whisper in the Twilight began with a dream. The colonized moon of Hippalectryon is at war. The Zharatians, a violent cult of zealots have captured vast territories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/39504583c2a0e1febc5a64b167f7021e.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><br>The player character Zory hails from an ancient tribe known as The Skywatchers. She is one of the last of her kind. She must now save her sister and defeat a dictator.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/bbfc1209c7f1f3e5382e4ecb9db2c0ed.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><br>The game is based on a strong narrative component, which relies heavily on player immersion and environmental details. The player will need to solve puzzles, discover clues, and evade danger to succeed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/8127014c1533352168f752fab93b3e8c.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=315 /></span><br><br>You will interact with exotic plants, animals, archaic artifacts... you will explore parallel dimensions... and you will transfer your inner spirit into alien creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/bfa4a4d07a12fcbf30161d374ece0ccb.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=272 /></span><br><br>The world of Hippalectryon is rich with lore and intrigue. You must unlock the Mechanical Arcana to prevail. Techo-merchants, mysteries, lost powers, and dangerous creatures await...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/f0f8046f0cdf8593cdafa5c28218cdf0.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=343 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2422840?t=1697803710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1697803710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1697803710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1697803710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/a8187b6ab3a26c6a567df4ae04923075.avif?t=1697803710\" width=192 height=192 /></span><br>A Whisper in the Twilight is a first person Mystery/Sci-Fi/Puzzle game. A wholly unique player experience, aiming to reinvent the single-player genre.<br><br>If you want to immerse yourself in the story before playing, we recommend you read/download for free the short graphic novel that serves as a prologue to this adventure directly from the game's official website:<br><br><br>The game will be released in ten self-contained Chapters.<br>&quot;CHAPTER ONE: THE JOURNEY BEGINS&quot; is the first one.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/1b8d998256d6a702c61432c4719df38d.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><br>The concept of A Whisper in the Twilight began with a dream. The colonized moon of Hippalectryon is at war. The Zharatians, a violent cult of zealots have captured vast territories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/39504583c2a0e1febc5a64b167f7021e.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><br>The player character Zory hails from an ancient tribe known as The Skywatchers. She is one of the last of her kind. She must now save her sister and defeat a dictator.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/bbfc1209c7f1f3e5382e4ecb9db2c0ed.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=342 /></span><br><br>The game is based on a strong narrative component, which relies heavily on player immersion and environmental details. The player will need to solve puzzles, discover clues, and evade danger to succeed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422840/extras/8127014c1533352168f752fab93b3e8c.avif?t=1697803710\" width=610 height=315 /></span><br><br>You will interact with exotic plants, animals, archaic artifacts... you will e